s/115-canonical-state-convergence/overview]] removed the last snapshot-structure fallback in `internal/snapshot`.\nbrain/codebase/merge-recovery-synthetic-cooks-must-preserve-task-key.md:5:- `TaskKey` and `Skill` are separate canonical fields. Recovery code that rewrites `TaskKey` to `Skill` silently corrupts downstream metadata.\nbrain/codebase/sprites-session-outcome-resolution-ordering.md:5:- Stream completion is a hard ordering barrier: resolve outcome only after canonical stream processing closes (`closeStreamDone`), or terminal events can be missed.\nbrain/codebase/codex-launch-carrier-contract.md:38:First stdout/stderr read and first canonical `init` are separate observations;\nbrain/codebase/codex-launch-carrier-contract.md:55:must not become an admission rule for Noodle worktree operations. The corrected\nNOODLE_ORDER_ID=noodle-84\nNOODLE_SESSION_ID=noodle-84-0-execute-20260917-070217-b3d88a\nNOODLE_STAGE_INDEX=0\nEmit an external event\n\nUsage:\n  noodle event emit <type> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for emit\n      --payload string   Event payload as JSON\n      --session string   Session ID (writes to session event log instead of loop event log)\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --project-dir string   project directory (default: current directory, env: NOODLE_PROJECT_DIR)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
